":0,"id":708226898,"label":"","name":"SHA256SUMS.txt","node_id":"RA_kwDOVR8FZ84qNq9S","size":128,"state":"uploaded","updated_at":"2026-11-04T04:30:39Z","uploader":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","id":41898282,"login":"github-actions[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Computational-social-science/Eidos/releases/assets/708226898"}],"assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Computational-social-science/Eidos/releases/433514905/assets","author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","id":41898282,"login":"github-actions[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"body":"# EIDOS Agent 0.5.0 compatibility preview\n\nThis preview adds a project-local CLI, read-only worker observations and a guarded\nsoftware incident ledger. It retains distribution `eidos` and namespace\n`framework`, and adds the `eidos-agent` console alias alongside `eidos`.\nThe public-index distribution/import migration remains separate; install the\nverified GitHub wheel rather than the unrelated PyPI `eidos` package.\n\nThe default path uses local/free resources and needs neither Gemini nor a paid\nmodel API. A worker installation does not install or migrate a resident central\ncontroller, restart services or qualify a model as a scientific reasoner.\n\n## Inspected artifact\n\nWheel: `eidos-0.5.0-py3-none-any.whl`\n\nSHA256: `56d2fe35b1e5ab552fe001ae675e3af4f095e78522fa8fae682f5ea41cfa301c`\n\nThe wheel contains 51 framework modules. Its embedded README was captured at its\ndevelopment build checkpoint. These exact qualified bytes are published without\nrebuilding; source/module identity and packaging declarations are checked against\nthe release tree. Release status comes from the actual tag, CI and release assets.\n\nNative Windows and a same-host network-disabled Linux container pass the normal\ninstalled numerical, process-lifecycle and recovery-shell drivers. The Linux\ntrial also exercises both console aliases and the old/repaired inherited-pipe\navailability comparison. The Linux root and input mounts are read-only, scratch\nis executable and owned-container cleanup is verified. This is not a new-machine,\nGPU, full installed-controller or 24-hour soak qualification.\n\n## Software feedback campaign\n\nThe deterministic producer in `reference/feedback_acceptance/campaign.py` seals\nits evaluator, fixture, original owner and wheel identities before candidate\nevaluation. It executes the original `audit_inference` owner under the triggering\ninherited-pipe input, alongside lower-level and unaffected controls. Unentered\ntimeouts cannot count as reproduced failures. A deliberate unchanged-SDK candidate\nis rejected; physical pin reversion preserves nonempty actual run history.\n\nPreparation reaches VALIDATED and refuses premature closure. Actual publication,\nCI/tag/asset fetching, originating-project adoption, failed-replay reversion and\nfresh successful replay are executed only after the release exists. Their final\nresult is a separate post-publication receipt; these notes do not predeclare it.\nThe originating project's scientific status remains UNRUN for this software case.\n\nThe incident ledger verifies local receipt integrity. The deterministic producer\nexecutes its protected oracle and fetches real public GitHub records; hashes alone\ndo not establish arbitrary evaluator honesty, scientific novelty or scientific RSI.\n\n## Compatibility and retained evidence\n\nExisting research files, frozen scientific artifacts and historical releases\nretain their identities. Controlled old/bad/repaired artifacts and failed attempts\nare retained rather than relabelled. The source self-audit measured 1,363 passing\nchecks, six skips, 77% whole-framework coverage and ten passing/one skipped chains.\nThe feedback module's focused coverage is 83% under its separate measured scope.\nTen additional producer controls cover refusal and interruption cleanup.\n","created_at":"2026-11-04T04:30:22Z","draft":false,"html_url":"https://github.com/Computational-social-science/Eidos/releases/tag/v0.5.0","id":433514905,"immutable":false,"name":"EIDOS Agent 0.5.0 \u2014 compatibility preview","node_id":"RE_kwDOVR8FZ84Z1umZ","prerelease":true,"published_at":"2026-11-04T04:30:41Z","tag_name":"v0.5.0","tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Computational-social-science/Eidos/tarball/v0.5.0","target_commitish":"main","updated_at":"2026-11-04T04:30:41Z","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/Computational-social-science/Eidos/releases/433514905/assets{?name,label}","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Computational-social-science/Eidos/releases/433514905","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Computational-social-science/Eidos/zipball/v0.5.0"}
